  How you'll open your Apps
  Choose how phones, TVs and laptops will open your Apps. Home network needs
  nothing to set up. You can change this later in Settings, under Access.

    ● Home network (default)
    ○ Easy names at home
  > ○ From anywhere, privately
    ○ Your own web address
    ○ Bring your own
    ○ This computer only

  Tailscale lets you open each App with its own private HTTPS name from your
  phone, laptop or TV, wherever you are. Existing IP:port Addresses and
  firewall rules stay unchanged.

